@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Error and exception handling
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

start
:Observe validation / guarded operation result;
if (Invalid, denied or conflict?) then (yes)
 :Return safe bounded refusal;
else (no)
 if (Commit confirmed?) then (yes)
  :Return permitted recorded success;
 else (no)
  if (Authoritative no-commit evidence?) then (yes)
   :Rollback / release as applicable;
   :Return actual no-commit failure;
  else (unknown)
   :Retain same command identity;
   :Reconcile under current authority and chosen guard;
   if (Result now established?) then (yes)
    :Return truthful permitted result;
   else (no)
    :Return unresolved / intervention reference;
   endif
  endif
 endif
endif
:Release resources without erasing outcome evidence;
stop

@enduml
